uth)\n\u2192 (3) parallel agents write their findings back into the repo (notes, citation, etc)\n\nYou get faster + more accurate results, and everything lands locally so any agent can resume where it left off"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"y8PluoBSX","title":"RT @nickscamara_: you can now upload and parse any document with firecrawl\n\npowered by our new rust-based parser\n\u2192 layout accuracy awarenes\u2026","url":"https://x.com/nickscamara_/status/2049518193195057571","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/rt-nickscamara-you-can-now-upload-and-parse-any-document-with-firecrawl-powered-by-our-new-rust--y8pluobsx","summary":"Firecrawl has added document upload and parsing capabilities, powered by a new Rust-based parser with layout accuracy awareness.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--VDukGCjf--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2002","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-29T15:56:30.000Z"},{"id":"ouwFxfl8R","title":"you can now upload and parse any document with firecrawl\n\npowered by our new rust-based parser\n\u2192 layout accuracy awareness\n\u2192 smart OCR routing\n\u2192 5x higher speeds\n\u2192 supports pdfs, xlsx, docx, html","url":"https://x.com/nickscamara_/status/2049165189128335821","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/you-can-now-upload-and-parse-any-document-with-firecrawl-powered-by-our-new-rust-based-parser-lay-ouwfxfl8r","summary":"Firecrawl now supports uploading and parsing any document type including PDFs, XLSX, DOCX, and HTML. The feature is powered by a new Rust-based parser offering layout accuracy awareness, smart OCR routing, and 5x higher processing speeds compared to previous capabilities.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--1KxV4ohY--/f_auto/v1722860400/public/Placeholder%2007","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-28T16:33:47.000Z"},{"id":"detD4e08c","title":"we tell you what pages changed and what changed\n\nfresh, low latency, baked in our endpoints","url":"https://x.com/nickscamara_/status/2046986725403119778","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/we-tell-you-what-pages-changed-and-what-changed-fresh-low-latency-baked-in-our-endpoints-detd4e08c","summary":"A service that monitors web pages and detects changes, delivering fresh, low-latency change notifications via API endpoints.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--CxzD6vbw--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2005","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-22T16:17:21.000Z"},{"id":"RL7WSBd4l","title":"RT @WesRoth: Firecrawl open-sourced \"web-agent,\" a new framework that allows developers to build AI agents capable of autonomously executin\u2026","url":"https://x.com/nickscamara_/status/2046336495871492447","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/rt-wesroth-firecrawl-open-sourced-web-agent-a-new-framework-that-allows-developers-to-build-ai--rl7wsbd4l","summary":"Firecrawl has open-sourced a 'web-agent' framework that enables developers to build AI agents capable of autonomously executing tasks on the web.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--ZrL_HSsR--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2006","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-20T21:13:34.000Z"},{"id":"06egLcBr6","title":"RT @nickscamara_: all agents need is 3 primitives for web data\n\n> search: find relevant URLs across the web\n> scrape: fetch clean data from\u2026","url":"https://x.com/nickscamara_/status/2044425598886608919","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/rt-nickscamara-all-agents-need-is-3-primitives-for-web-data-search-find-relevant-urls-across--06eglcbr6","summary":"A tweet arguing that AI agents only need three core primitives for web data access: search (finding relevant URLs), scrape (fetching clean data), and an implied third primitive. Advocates for a minimal, composable approach to web data in agent architectures.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--foaA6JGU--/f_auto/v172