99/public/Placeholder%2002","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-09T16:50:41.000Z"},{"id":"LtcAE8qMJ","title":"RT @nickscamara_: all agents need is 3 primitives for web data\n\n> search: find relevant URLs across the web\n> scrape: fetch clean data from\u2026","url":"https://x.com/nickscamara_/status/2041997192727286150","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/rt-nickscamara-all-agents-need-is-3-primitives-for-web-data-search-find-relevant-urls-across--ltcae8qmj","summary":"A tweet arguing that web agents only need three core primitives: search (finding relevant URLs), scrape (fetching clean data), and a third implied primitive for handling web data effectively.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--foaA6JGU--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2004","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-08T21:50:43.000Z"},{"id":"ih9pl0Hvn","title":"all agents need is 3 primitives for web data\n\n> search: find relevant URLs across the web\n> scrape: fetch clean data from each page\n> interact: extract data behind actions\n\nnpx -y firecrawl-cli@latest init --all --browser","url":"https://x.com/nickscamara_/status/2041905053171380661","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/all-agents-need-is-3-primitives-for-web-data-search-find-relevant-urls-across-the-web-scrape--ih9pl0hvn","summary":"Web agents need just three core primitives to handle web data: search (finding relevant URLs), scrape (fetching clean page content), and interact (extracting data behind user actions like clicks/forms). The Firecrawl CLI provides all three via a single npx command with browser support.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--0_ODbtD2--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2008","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-08T15:44:36.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["sourcegraph","baconbrix","cognition","xai","skirano"],"opposite_handles":["on_leuwcq","dailydevworld","ergq3auoe","horde","webcraft"],"similar":[{"id":